cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the dossier you use (each has its own DOI); cite the portal only for the site itself."
title: "Open Source Brazilian Intelligence Agency: portal of open-source intelligence on Brazilian politics and public data"
abstract: >-
  Static portal that publishes independent open-source-intelligence dossiers on Brazilian politics
  and public data. Each dossier lives in its own repository with a hash chain, a sealed
  pre-registration, tests and a DOI; the portal keeps a sealed copy of each published page and
  records its hash and origin. Independent project with no link to any government body.
authors:
